Documentation.UserDocu:
cacheInfo() -> dict: the frame cache (the Cache property). Times, the frames kept;
OnDisk, those of them that are on disk only; Bytes, what memory holds of them, estimated;
DiskBytes, what their files hold; Stored, how many frames were recomputed and kept;
Replayed, how many were put back instead of recomputed; Spilled, how many were moved out
of memory onto disk; Loaded, how many were read back
